{"id":"42a3ef8675246492","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-convergence-logic.md","title":"Normal Logics Generated by Convergence Schemes","display":"df-convergence-logic — Normal Logics Generated by Convergence Schemes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-convergence-logic","aliases":["89-df-convergence-logic"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-convergence-logic — Normal Logics Generated by Convergence Schemes","depends_on":["[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-convergent-frame]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-convergence-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-convergence-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-convergence-logic — Normal Logics Generated by Convergence Schemes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e81fa800505e986\" href=\"?note=3e81fa800505e986\" title=\"89-df-convergent-frame\">89-df-convergent-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq\\omega^4\">\\(a\\subseteq\\omega^4\\)</span> 是四元组集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> 为正规逻辑谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_a\">\\(E_a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K_a\">\\(\\mathrm K_a\\)</span> 为下文构造的公式集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conv}_a\">\\(\\mathrm{Conv}_a\\)</span> 是相应框架谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A\\mid\n(i,j,m,n)\\in a,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm K_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\land E_a\\subseteq L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_a(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(i,j,m,n)\\in a\\;\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A\\mid\n(i,j,m,n)\\in a,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm K_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\land E_a\\subseteq L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_a(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(i,j,m,n)\\in a\\;\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 89–90；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>公式全集是交集候选；正规性逐项保持于交集，故得到最小正规逻辑。单世界自反框架中所有关系幂都是恒等关系，满足任意四元组收敛；其有效公式集合是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_a\">\\(E_a\\)</span> 的一致正规候选，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin\\mathrm K_a\">\\(\\bot\\notin\\mathrm K_a\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 不假定可计算，这个定义及后续完全性本身不推出算法可判定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-convergent-frame","status":"resolved","id":"3e81fa800505e986","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-convergent-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a\\subseteq\\omega^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}","display":false},{"tex":"E_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm K_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conv}_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_a&\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A\\mid\n(i,j,m,n)\\in a,\\ A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm K_a&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\land E_a\\subseteq L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_a(F)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(i,j,m,n)\\in a\\;\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin\\mathrm K_a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false}],"bytes":1512,"backlinks":[{"id":"852a0356bca26d3a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-convergent-frame]]、[[89-df-convergence-logic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-convergence-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["bdef52f3ff411531","3e81fa800505e986"]}